  "description": "<h1 data-path-to-node=\"2\">Premium Handcrafted Spun Bamboo Bowls – Natural Elegance Meets Modern Craftsmanship</h1>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"3\"><b data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Item Code:</b> VH24029</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4\"><b data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Category:</b> Eco-Friendly Homeware / Kitchenware &amp; Decorative Bowls</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\"><b data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Origin:</b> Vietnam</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"6\"><b data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Overview</b></h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">Elevate your product catalog with our handcrafted <b data-path-to-node=\"7\" data-index-in-node=\"50\">Spun Bamboo Bowl Set (Item Code: VH24029)</b>. Combining the rustic warmth of natural bamboo with striking black line accents (black joints/grooves), this collection offers a perfect blend of traditional Vietnamese artisanship and contemporary design.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8\">Made from 100% natural, fast-renewing bamboo, these bowls are ideal for eco-conscious consumers looking for durable, aesthetic, and sustainable tableware or decorative accents for home, hotel, and restaurant spaces.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"10\"><b data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Key Features &amp; Product Highlights</b></h3>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"11\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Authentic Spun Bamboo Craftsmanship:</b> Expertly coiled and shaped by skilled artisans in Vietnam, ensuring high strength, smooth finishing, and long-lasting durability.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Unique Aesthetic Design:</b> Features a rich natural bamboo tone contrasted with subtle black line details between bamboo layers, accentuating the organic pattern and fine texture of the material.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Eco-Friendly &amp; Sustainable:</b> Made from renewable, natural bamboo—a premium alternative to plastic or synthetic materials that appeals directly to green-minded markets.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"11,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Versatile Application:</b> Perfect as serving bowls, salad/fruit bowls, key holders, or centerpiece decorative items in dining rooms, living rooms, and hospitality environments.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"13\"><b data-path-to-node=\"13\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Why Partner With Us? (OEM / ODM Wholesale Solutions)</b></h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14\">We are a trusted Vietnamese manufacturer dedicated to supplying high-quality handicraft products to international importers, distributors, and retail chains.</p>\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"15\"><b data-path-to-node=\"15\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">1. Full Customization (OEM &amp; ODM Available)</b></h4>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16\">We understand that every market has unique trends and customer requirements. We provide flexible OEM/ODM manufacturing services, including:</p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"17\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"17,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Custom Sizes &amp; Shapes:</b> Available in various diameters, depths, and set configurations.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"17,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Custom Colors &amp; Finishes:</b> Natural finish, matte lacquer, glossy coating, custom painted exteriors, or specialized inner linings.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"17,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Branding &amp; Packaging:</b> Custom logo placement (laser engraving, brand stamps) and retail-ready eco-friendly packaging tailored to your brand standards.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"18\"><b data-path-to-node=\"18\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">2. Strict Quality Assurance</b></h4>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19\">From material selection and anti-mold/pest treatment to final lacquering and inspection, our strict Quality Control (QC) process guarantees consistent export-standard craftsmanship across all units.</p>\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"20\"><b data-path-to-node=\"20\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">3. Reliable Production Capacity &amp; On-Time Delivery</b></h4>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"21\">Supported by an established production network and experienced craftspeople, we handle high-volume wholesale orders efficiently while adhering strictly to agreed shipping schedules and lead times.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"23\"><b data-path-to-node=\"23\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Specifications at a Glance</b></h3>\n<table data-path-to-node=\"24\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Feature</strong></td>\n<td><strong>Details</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"24,1,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"24,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Product Name</b></span></td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"24,1,1,0\">Spun Bamboo Bowls (Natural Finish with Black Accents)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"24,2,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"24,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Material</b></span></td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"24,2,1,0\">100% Natural Bamboo</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"24,3,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"24,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Technique</b></span></td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"24,3,1,0\">Hand-spun / Coiled Bamboo</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"24,4,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"24,4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Color</b></span></td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"24,4,1,0\">Natural Bamboo with Black Grooves (Customizable)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"24,5,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"24,5,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Usage</b></span></td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"24,5,1,0\">Home Decor, Kitchenware, Tableware, Fruit/Salad Bowl, Giftware</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"24,6,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"24,6,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Customization</b></span></td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"24,6,1,0\">Size, Color, Logo, and Packaging upon request</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"24,7,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"24,7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Supply Ability</b></span></td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"24,7,1,0\">Bulk production with strict quality standard compliance</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"26\"><b data-path-to-node=\"26\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Ready to Expand Your Eco-Friendly Product Line?</b></h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"27\">Contact our export team today for product catalogs, custom sampling, and competitive FOB wholesale pricing.</p>",
